rect answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $b$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{first}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}-3}$, and add the equations*."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186508345 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186192655 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3e7bfcbe-4913-53e0-98c7-171965adfe62" :knowledge-point/title "Eliminating the Second Variable" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050190 :topic/title "Solving Systems of Linear Equations Using Elimination: One Transformation"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19abff8d-ae9e-5607-a20e-fabfdd36db34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508258} {:answer/id #uuid "20a941f3-cb0b-5f69-ab43-56c13080d620" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508261} {:answer/id #uuid "46814826-f010-593a-b3e8-5f63f785645f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508282} {:answer/id #uuid "5594cdc5-034f-5627-abd8-dfbefb4c1912" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508296}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "46814826-f010-593a-b3e8-5f63f785645f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508282} :answer-field/id #uuid "4818456c-7db3-59a9-b5db-3d94bdb07372" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508285} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "50462789-9e2f-5032-b20b-8a96a67c5b5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "second" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186508291} {:answer/id #uuid "ca8962f5-867a-5f1