n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n6s + 30t &= 48 \\\\\n-6s - 3t &= -11 \\\\\n(30t - 3t) &= (48 - 11) \\\\\n27t &= 37\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n> *To eliminate $s$, multiply the $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}\\text{first}}$ equation by $\\bbox[3pt,Gainsboro]{\\color{blue}6}$, and add the equations*."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509176 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186192654 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "93dcc73c-ce2d-5fa3-b32b-9fc600fb269e" :knowledge-point/title "Eliminating the First Variable" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050190 :topic/title "Solving Systems of Linear Equations Using Elimination: One Transformation"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b6c98e2-b881-582d-9f5f-0b5e631af0d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "second" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509136} {:answer/id #uuid "41817a51-4551-5887-8edc-4f68222f6c52" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "first" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509154}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "41817a51-4551-5887-8edc-4f68222f6c52" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "first" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509154} :answer-field/id #uuid "1017d759-4b65-5a74-84cd-294669705e4d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509129} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9355d920-8afb-5d5c-bf18-878687504ae4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509194} {:answer/id #uuid "a71c0001-ba06-517a-9199-dabed82358f1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186509201} {:answer/id #uuid "def5b0ef-7a2c-5d73-a7df-a22cf11be967" :answer